NPC
ID:94;X:-200192;Y:-200150;D:1;MG:"A princess should not be making house calls to a plumber!";FD:1;NM:1;
ID:94;X:-201376;Y:-200150;D:1;MG:"I saw the whole thing. Good luck <characterName>\, you're gonna need it.";FD:1;NM:1;
ID:9;X:-159728;Y:-160128;D:-1;NM:1;ED:"kirby";
ID:94;X:-200000;Y:-200150;D:1;MG:"Hey\, <characterName>. You have a nice looking house.<page>I hear that this \"strawberry\" asthetic is getting popular.<page>I must warn you that things are only going to get more and more chocolate.<page>Enjoy as much vanilla as you can\, you filthy casual.";FD:1;NM:1;LR:"too intelligent";ET:"Hi I'm Toad";
ID:94;X:-200000;Y:-200150;D:1;MG:"HI I'M TOAD \:D";FD:1;NM:1;LR:"intelligent enough";
ID:75;X:-199459;Y:-200118;D:-1;MG:"A princess broke into my house thinking it was yours!";FD:1;NM:1;
ID:94;X:-159456;Y:-160278;D:1;MG:"My father is loyal to the Monarch\, praying that she is going to be safe after this.<page>One must wonder however why said monarch isn't able to keep themselves safe\,<page>especially after repetative attacks on her kingdom.<page>Surely she doesn't need to rely on a plumber each and every time\, right?";FD:1;LR:"it1";ET:"it";EE:"it";
ID:221;X:-159544;Y:-160096;D:-1;
ID:221;X:-159544;Y:-160128;D:-1;
ID:221;X:-159544;Y:-160160;D:-1;
ID:221;X:-159544;Y:-160192;D:-1;
ID:221;X:-159544;Y:-160224;D:-1;
ID:94;X:-159456;Y:-160278;D:1;MG:"You've done this longer than I've been alive though.<page>I'm sure you know what you're doing.";FD:1;LR:"it2";
ID:1;X:-159376;Y:-160272;D:-1;MG:"BREAKING NEWS!<page>Bowser has managed to find forces from different realities to help in his latest invasion 2 the mushroom kingdom.<page>Now\, as a Goomba myself I should know just how powerful the bros in red and green can be<page>but even I'm uncertain if they will be able to take these forces down on their own.";FD:1;NM:1;LR:"T";ED:"TV";ET:"TV";
ID:1;X:-159376;Y:-160272;D:-1;MG:"Evacuation routes out of Toad Town are currently being routed.<page>As for those of you in the outskirts\, be safe\, as several ships have been spotted around the kingdom.<page>Be safe out there\, from all of us at 6 news.";FD:1;NM:1;LR:"V";
ID:403;X:-159680;Y:-160116;D:-1;MG:"I don't think I can eat another bite of this.<page><characterNameSingle>\, you can have my leftovers.";FD:1;LR:"fullby";
ID:403;X:-159680;Y:-160116;D:-1;MG:"Hey\, thanks. I wasn't gonna finish that anyway.";FD:1;LR:"kirbfull";
ID:198;X:-200336;Y:-200192;D:-1;MG:"Please be careful\, the road ahead is dangerous.";FD:1;NM:1;
ID:7;X:-200896;Y:-200160;D:-1;MG:"I'm homeless";FD:1;NM:1;
ID:1000;X:-200128;Y:-200224;D:1;
NPC_END
